  "Description": "The LoadStep goal is designed to filter a specific goal based on the line number provided in the request body. It extracts the first item from the filtered goal's parent and writes it to the %step% variable. Depending on whether the %step.EventBinding% is empty or not, it either displays an event or calls a function to display the step.",
